<title>FRANCE: AXA, UAP to requote on Thursday.</title>
<headline>AXA, UAP to requote on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French financial markets committee (CMF), the markets supervisory body, said its chairman had decided that shares in insurers AXA and UAP could requote on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday the two insurance companies announced a merger plan in which AXA is making a share swap offer for UAP shares.</p>
<p>The CMF, the successor to the COB, said it would study the offer and make its decision known at the start of next week.  </p>
<p>It said the rules, procedures and timetable for public offers had started on November 12, the date of the offer announcment.</p>
</text>
